From 49b0e29cb3b77cc708de352228b602f69a5f55cb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gemini experiment archive <experiment@invalid.example>
Date: Thu, 10 Sep 2026 08:05:22 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] wlan: capture native EMI protection and copy

Record each later firmware section, the existing mapping result and the
arguments surrounding the native copy. Carry the section ordinal through
the locked MPU wrapper to capture the actual lower secure-call result,
which the native wrapper discards. Preserve the wrapper return and all
native permission, mapping and copy operations.

Keep the existing protection APIs as zero-capture wrappers. The observer
adds no mapping cleanup or payload reads, and does not repair native
mapping/span failures. Section records identify observations, not memory
ownership, copy visibility or interval firmware immutability.

This unselected native experiment is not an upstream ABI or boot candidate.
The synthetic archive identity supplies no author certification.
